{"version": "v0.9", "updateDataModel": {"surfaceId": "release", "value": {"intro": "Two commits since =v0.1.2=, and one of them adds tools, so I'd make this a *minor* release.  I drafted the CHANGELOG entry from them; edit it, tick the checks as they pass (or press *Run checks for me*), then *Tag and push*.", "bump": ["minor"], "version": "0.2.0", "date": "2026-11-07", "commits": [{"sha": "83d08cd", "subject": "Release 0.2.0: save and recall UIs in the main editing area"}, {"sha": "7fc38f2", "subject": "README: document where surfaces appear"}], "changelog": "- Standalone surfaces prefer the main editing area, reusing an ordinary window without replacing side windows or moving focus. Customize `a2ui-vui-display-action` to change placement.\n\n- Add `save_a2ui`, `list_a2ui`, and `recall_a2ui` to gptel, MCP, and agent-shell.", "checks": {"tests": false, "lint": false, "header": false, "changelog_file": false, "readme": false, "tree": false}}}}
